OL,3,AHuntingdon train attacker found guilty
OL,4,Aof all 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthony Williams has been found guilty
OL,7,Fof all 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,9,FWilliams, 33, attacked 10 people on an
OL,10,FLNER train from Peterborough to London
OL,11,Fon 1 November last year
OL,13,FHe denied 14 counts in total of
OL,14,Fattempted murder, including attacks
OL,15,Faway from the train, in Peterborough
OL,16,Fand London
OL,18,FThe jury initially found Williams
OL,19,Fguilty of seven counts - but had yet to
OL,20,Freach verdicts on the remaining seven
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
